From cd2fe4eb34a9f77eacbeea69c87365d8dcf60cc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amir Latipov <kimciwork@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:50:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(ai-lab): headless AI-vs-AI skirmish mode (-aiMatch)

-headless -aiMatch -aiMap <map> -aiPlayer <Faction>:<difficulty> ...
-aiSeed -aiCash -aiMaxMinutes -aiResult <json>. Builds SkirmishGameInfo
from flags, runs logic without rendering or FPS limit (as ReplaySimulation),
writes winner, structure counts and final CRC to JSON, exits via _exit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
